### Pass-4 review (2026-09-29): REJECT, 3 Major + 1 Minor findings — addressed in rev 5

Review: gpt-6-astra, codex 0.155.1, read-only sandbox, 2026-09-29; verdict REJECT; output
`research-tmp/reviews/plan-v3-pass4-output.txt`. The pass-1 and pass-2 disposition tables above are preserved byte-identical to rev 5. The pass-3 table is retained with correction annotations on items 1–2 (the rev-4 claims the pass-4 audit rejected as inaccurate); all other pass-3 items are preserved unchanged. Each pass-4 finding is addressed below (§ references are to this revision).

1. **Major — §8.6 F1 imputation still permits a false PASS (observed-max base imputation).** FIXED: §8.6
   now imputes missing base F1 with the actual upper bound 1 (an observed maximum does not bound an
   unseen base score — the pass-4 counterexample, 5 missing base rows at true 1.0 flipping FAIL to PASS
   under the rev-4 rule, is now covered); tuned-missing stays 0. The false conservatism claim
   ("can only lower Δ, never inflate it") is removed from §8.6 and annotated-corrected in §12. The
   complete-loss measurement requirement is retained, as is the ≤5% missing-rate threshold (pooled AND
   per-dataset).
2. **Major — §8.8 G-A2 retained the contradictory overlap-exclusion instruction.** FIXED: the "any
   overlapping probe is excluded" instruction in the §8.8 Battery paragraph is DELETED; the fixed-60 /
   any-overlap-invalidates contract is now the single authoritative population rule throughout §8.8
   (disjointness re-verified BEFORE scoring; ANY overlap invalidates the instrument → measurement
   missing → NO-SHIP; overlap never produces exclusion, replacement, or a reduced-n measurement).
3. **Major — the pinned G-D instrument has no reference labels (all 100 rows have `"labels": ""`).**
   FIXED (binding approach): §8.9 now carries a precise G-D reference-label acceptance contract — gold
   span annotations for exactly these 100 documents must be authored and independently verified BEFORE
   the §8 eval chain runs; the labels bundle is receipted (sha256 pinned, annotator + verification
   method recorded); scoring contract: span-F1 ≥ 0.75 against those gold spans, fabricated-IOC ≤10%.
   Until the verified labels bundle exists, the G-D measurement is missing → G-D CANNOT PASS (NO-SHIP).
   Empty `"labels"` fields are never treated as verified empty gold answers.
4. **Minor — G-G IFEval provenance overstated ("public benchmarks held out of training").** FIXED: §8.9
   now describes the 40-row set as the retained 40-prompt authored instruction-following instrument
   `cap_probes.PB.IFEVAL` (per its receipt: official IFEval's 541 prompts were not cached); it is NOT
   an official IFEval benchmark result and conclusions are limited to that instrument. GSM8K remains the
   1,200-row public benchmark held out of training. Floor and criterion unchanged.

