**Executable eval claims verified (not asserted).** Two claims in this plan were tested against the
real artifacts rather than trusted (`docs/evidence/eval-claim-verification.txt`):
- **§8.4's own acceptance requirement** — "this frozen vocabulary must score those same 12 replies
  12/12 with R=1". Run through `tools/refusal_rule_v3.py` over
